sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Person (Jira)
    participant O as Orchestration
    participant P as Planning
    participant R as System of record
    participant M as Memsy
    U->>O: @Aetherion create TDD
    O->>P: mode=facts (story)
    P->>R: stored facts + current version
    P->>M: search actor_id=tdd:BTS-25 (history)
    P-->>O: same / changed slots / unsure
    alt same
        O-->>U: TDD v1.3 unchanged (link)
    else changed
        O->>P: revise v1.3, changed slots only, decisions in force
        P->>R: facts, v1.4, decisions
        P->>M: ingest app_event + tool_result (async)
        P-->>O: TDD v1.4 + what changed
        O-->>U: TDD v1.4: daily_limit 2,00,000 → 2,50,000
    end
